{"task":{"id":"Prob093_ece241_2014_q3","spec":"
I would like you to implement a module named TopModule with the following
interface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise
specified.

 - input  c
 - input  d
 - output mux_in (4 bits)

For the following Karnaugh map, give the circuit implementation using one
4-to-1 multiplexer and as many 2-to-1 multiplexers as required, but using
as few as possible. You are not allowed to use any other logic gate and
you must use _a_ and _b_ as the multiplexer selector inputs, as shown on
the 4-to-1 multiplexer below.

      ab
  cd  00  01  11  10
  00 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1 |
  01 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
  11 | 1 | 0 | 1 | 1 |
  10 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1 |

Consider a block diagram with inputs 'c' and 'd' going into a module
called "TopModule". This "TopModule" has four outputs, mux_in[3:0], that
connect to a four input mux. The mux takes as input {a,b} and ab = 00 is
connected to mux_in[0], ab=01 is connected to mux_in[1], and so in. You
are implementing in Verilog just the portion labelled "TopModule", such
that the entire circuit (including the 4-to-1 mux) implements the K-map.

","interface":{"top":"TopModule","ports":[{"name":"c","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false},{"name":"d","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false},{"name":"mux_in","direction":"output","width":4,"signed":false}]},"constraints":"SystemVerilog, exactly one self-contained TopModule DUT. Inline all helper logic inside TopModule; do not define auxiliary modules. xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns synthesis clock; simulator seed 1. No reference dependencies, hierarchy outside the DUT, file access, includes or DPI."},"current":{"revision_id":"edc021b9-ffd7-45c6-93c9-5b5294892d37","source_sha256":"ff0799dcb2b38e056d5fb70fa274cb6f9e9b24eba7bc7ebcb3e01d893e5d6311","source":"module TopModule (
    input c,
    input d,
    output [3:0] mux_in
);
    // K-map columns selected by {a,b}:
    //   ab=00 -> mux_in[0], ab=01 -> mux_in[1], ab=11 -> mux_in[2], ab=10 -> mux_in[3]
    // Column ab=00: c|d
    // Column ab=01: 0
    // Column ab=11: c&d
    // Column ab=10: c|~d
    assign mux_in[0] = c | d;
    assign mux_in[1] = 1'b0;
    assign mux_in[2] = c & d;
    assign mux_in[3] = c | ~d;
endmodule
"},"previous_tool_result":{"tool":"edit_dut","accepted":true,"observation":{"revision_id":"edc021b9-ffd7-45c6-93c9-5b5294892d37","source_sha256":"ff0799dcb2b38e056d5fb70fa274cb6f9e9b24eba7bc7ebcb3e01d893e5d6311","verification_state":"UNVERIFIED","test_suite_id":"Prob093_ece241_2014_q3"}},"verification_key":null,"observed":null,"repair_control":{"mode":"normal","compacted":false,"best_revision_id":"f62e2c19-1f68-4df8-8eb2-588dadbe2352","best_source_sha256":"d9cc802c1fd0323a5bd37a7167b65d8fe6ef5f6a5a47cf723476f18e22593238","rejected":[{"revision_id":"4abe2f10-8c51-4d34-9b40-70de41411991","source_sha256":"99d1903f9d4b7312acc2af26b2108a68db01491dd416b2fc9188c1c9e14c8d32","reason":"NO_IMPROVEMENT","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"4b5a69e2-5e08-4e6d-b09c-bdf450090904","source_sha256":"765d41281a76516a1a1f2eaf1012dbaa476804ce98b496a6b7aeb8dc4797bb0f","reason":"NO_IMPROVEMENT","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"3757b0d1-c7c7-42c9-aa53-711e927f5604","source_sha256":"9d0c99f8acfb061cecb4a0e32e80ce239568b3f89a6e5123a8fbf0ae272b380a","reason":"NO_IMPROVEMENT","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"b09c7a36-06b5-4b1e-98ad-fff8f56617a8","source_sha256":"2a2ef3b6d2427e21c6d2e9b4bc54309d7ab5492a2bd8b28c97aa66f6cd2b892e","reason":"REGRESSION","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"faa43dbe-cfc0-4818-bda5-3841153c6660","source_sha256":"5b269fe1335baff19bfb973ba923dce5b1b5d728b7030db9ce423109129b54d9","reason":"REGRESSION","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"8a7ccea9-5aaa-4071-a25b-114bb74dbf10","source_sha256":"1a6fc343662cef5000921d1d3a6d0ed99b29946d9eae2378118506c14bab702b","reason":"REGRESSION","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"5d03c2b8-e111-4030-b60f-5caeafb9b690","source_sha256":"8e2aec0ba540b7110c31c7756c5ab45edc9365353b78745286f2c9fa66ba7e27","reason":"REGRESSION","checks":118,"mismatches":86},{"revision_id":"6abf6c97-f184-485a-94ed-f9bab058ac30","source_sha256":"0f889e18feb2ed996b9661687048b483039c20b55b22ab84e795881